              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyarau ekabaka loka Misiri akesidok, kobala kes atiar, “Kanukinyo iswamaata akirot ŋin, ainyein idwe lutelepai ejarete?” ",
          "type": "text",
